			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 1, DX 14, IQ 4, HT 10, HP 1, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 10, SPEED 6, MOVE 12, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDfWcpGjdnz6sYdWE",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 5, protection -9), threat tier minor, appearing 8."
		},
		{
			"id": "nrWUctet5JZvzs6uz",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/bat.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nWkjrpKa1jRY6RF_A",
			"text": "Independent build total: -101 points of racial traits plus 5 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nOHA4om6WSNf2LUgb",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Bat (SRD 5.1); Bat (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nEAkXsF9UdGKMqGoy",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nENUx-JmlC7bXryES",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 0.03 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvKKxtcjEUW6-bvBP",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 2; air Move 12 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nKkVj_j1acxc0LsfY",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJTMVeXacnNmXxbr_",
			"text": "Longest dimension about 25 cm with the wings out, which is the published table's SM -5 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "n3HAOfhlSgo_y6CDB",
			"text": "ST is the floor: 30 g of animal carrying nothing but itself."
		},
		{
			"id": "nImQdXRR-E4PRmmKH",
			"text": "Perception is only moderately raised. The bat's edge is not general alertness but one extraordinary sense, and Scanning Sense, Ultrahearing and Acute Hearing 4 are where that is paid for."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6zvcuA_c7e51UcfJ",
			"text": "Ground Move is deliberately crippled: a bat on the floor drags itself."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6gjNYHRPBer33r_S",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
